  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#40 - The Carved Pumpkin\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,22,47]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "As you light the candle, the Jack o’\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,47,84]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Lantern spews a mass of black\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,84,114]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "tendrils from its mouth. These\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,114,145]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "form limbs and a body as the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,145,174]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "pumpkin rolls out of your hands.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,174,207]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "In a few seconds, a pumpkinhead\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,207,239]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "demon stands before you, an evil\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,239,272]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "grin on its face.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,272,290]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“Serve me and I will give you great\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,290,326]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "power” he tells you.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,326,347]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you want to humor the creature,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,347,382]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "perform an L5 Charisma roll. Add\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,382,415]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "+1 for the Charisma Skill, +2 if you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,415,452]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have it at Expert level, and +1 if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,452,487]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you have a cursed knife.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,487,512]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If the roll is successful, the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,512,543]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "pumpkin demon will sign a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,543,569]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "contract with you. You will lose 1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,569,604]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "permanent point of Sanity, but\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,604,635]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you will gain 2 permanent Life\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,635,666]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "points (this also increases your\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,666,699]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "current Life point total if you are\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,699,735]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "wounded) and you may learn a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,735,764]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "single Arcane Skill of your choice.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,764,800]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you do not have enough XP to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,800,832]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "pay for it right now, you will learn\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,832,869]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the Skill later, as soon as you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,869,901]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "spend the XP.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,901,915]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If the roll is unsuccessful or you do\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,915,953]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "not want to roll, you will have to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,953,988]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "fight the pumpkin demon.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,988,1013]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Pumpkin Head Demon , L6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1013,1037]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "demon, 6 Life, damage 2.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1037,1062]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Vulnerable to holy water.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1062,1088]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may not escape from this\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1088,1117]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "combat.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1117,1125]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you defeat the demon, you will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1125,1159]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "find an item from the Random\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1159,1188]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-040:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Magic Items table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[94,1188,1207]]"
    }
